description:
@midonightmare In this chilling true story, we delve into the tragic events of August 28, 2016. Vina Dewi Arsita and her boyfriend Eki were found dead on Layang Talun Street in Cirebon, initially suspected to have died in an accident. However, Vina's spirit revealed a darker truth. Attacked and brutalized by the Moonreker motorcycle gang, their deaths were far from accidental. Discover how Vina's spirit uncovered the harrowing details and brought justice to light. Watch now to learn the full story.

If you enjoyed this video, please like, share, and subscribe for more creepy tales and mysteries! Hit the notification bell to stay updated on our latest content. Your support means the world to us!"

